  "exactGeometry": "Xa>0,t1>0 gives Xkeep=Xa*exp(t1/64)<Xcut=Xa*exp(t1/32)<a^2=Xa*exp(t1/16).",
  "conditionalProof": "For each actual outer system xi in [0,a], eta in its admitted domain: a guarded lower actual even-profile receives either X=xi^2 or X=t*xi^2 with its own literal t in [0,1]. Its exact same-X lazy guard restricts a reached profile call to 0<=X<=Xcut<a^2. Every lower actual Picard system has the same [0,a] radial domain and unchanged eta; hence sqrt(X) is admissible. Apply this finite lower-order induction through orders 1..5.",
